========================================================================
  PART 4: f-VECTOR RATIOS
========================================================================

  f_full / f_trans = 2^C(k+1,2) / (k+1)!
  = number of tournaments per transitive tournament
  = average iso class size = 'tournament entropy'

  k=0 (n=1): f_full/f_trans = 1 = 1.0000
  k=1 (n=2): f_full/f_trans = 1 = 1.0000
  k=2 (n=3): f_full/f_trans = 4/3 = 1.3333
  k=3 (n=4): f_full/f_trans = 8/3 = 2.6667
  k=4 (n=5): f_full/f_trans = 128/15 = 8.5333
  k=5 (n=6): f_full/f_trans = 2048/45 = 45.5111
  k=6 (n=7): f_full/f_trans = 131072/315 = 416.1016
  k=7 (n=8): f_full/f_trans = 2097152/315 = 6657.6254

  f_full / f_iso = 2^C(k+1,2) / A000568(k+1)
  = average labeled class size

  k=0 (n=1): f_full/f_iso = 1 = 1.00
  k=1 (n=2): f_full/f_iso = 2 = 2.00
  k=2 (n=3): f_full/f_iso = 8 = 8.00
  k=3 (n=4): f_full/f_iso = 32 = 32.00
  k=4 (n=5): f_full/f_iso = 256 = 256.00
  k=5 (n=6): f_full/f_iso = 8192/3 = 2730.67
  k=6 (n=7): f_full/f_iso = 262144/7 = 37449.14
  k=7 (n=8): f_full/f_iso = 33554432/57 = 588674.25
  k=8 (n=9): f_full/f_iso = 2147483648/215 = 9988296.04

  f_trans / f_iso = (k+1)! / A000568(k+1)
  = average automorphism group size

  k=0 (n=1): f_trans/f_iso = 1 = 1.0000
  k=1 (n=2): f_trans/f_iso = 2 = 2.0000
  k=2 (n=3): f_trans/f_iso = 6 = 6.0000
  k=3 (n=4): f_trans/f_iso = 12 = 12.0000
  k=4 (n=5): f_trans/f_iso = 30 = 30.0000
  k=5 (n=6): f_trans/f_iso = 60 = 60.0000
  k=6 (n=7): f_trans/f_iso = 90 = 90.0000
  k=7 (n=8): f_trans/f_iso = 1680/19 = 88.4211
  k=8 (n=9): f_trans/f_iso = 2268/43 = 52.7442

